B.zj=new A.W(B.XI,["PLAY","CREDITS","Built by ","Built with ","Hello my young knight!\nWhat are you doing here?","Hello!\nI was sent to rescue a child who was kidnapped by creatures that live in those neighborhoods.","Humm...\nI don't want to demotivate you, but you are the fifth knight sent for this task. So far, none have returned alive and their bodies are hanging from the walls like trophies.","Don't worry my old man. Knight like me never existed!\nI will exterminate every creature in this place and rescue the child!","Yes, confidence is what you don't lack!\nThen don't say I didn't warn you!\nGood luck!","Heeeelp! Heeeelp!","Shut up, you appetizing little creature!\nThe time has come to taste your soft skin! ha ha ha ha","It won't be your disgusting creature this time!\nYour monstrous days are over!","Look that! Another knight with an inflated ego thinking he can stop me! ha ha ha ha \nCome here!","Thank the gods !!! \nYou managed to defeat this horrible creature! Thank you very much! \nI don't even know how to thank you!","It was an honor to be able to help you! And don't worry about rewarding me, your father promised me a fortune to rescue you! :-)","PLAY AGAIN","CONGRATULATIONS!","Thank you for playing Shadow Depths!\nI hope you enjoyed the adventure.\nStay tuned for what comes next!","I think I need a key to get through here!"],t.w)
